//            same order: Internet & Apps, Video Games, Gadgets, Computing History, Founders & Companies
//   tier     1 (gimme) .. 5 (expert); a day ramps 5 questions per tier
//   choices  exactly four, one defensibly correct; the correct position came
//            from a per-day balanced no-3-run sequence at build time, so do NOT
//            hand-reorder choices here
//
// EVERY FACT IS FROZEN.
// Technology moves faster than anything: a product is discontinued, a company is sold, a record is beaten.
// So the bank asks only about settled things: who built what and when, how a device works, and milestones
// that are finished events.
// Nothing later than the 2024 calendar year.
//
// Extending the bank: author new days in the lane files, run
// scripts/gen-tech.mjs (it appends, never rewrites), then
// scripts/verify-tech.mjs. Never reuse an id or a question, and never let one
// day carry the same answer twice.
